00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,090
-Your latest invention?

543
00:17:48,090 --> 00:17:49,180
-Well, nothing special.

544
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:50,080
-You can say that again.

545
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:51,250
-Such a small gadget.

