555
00:18:07,270 --> 00:18:08,570
-Why of course.

556
00:18:08,570 --> 00:18:09,870
Why shouldn't he?

557
00:18:09,870 --> 00:18:11,070
-Oh, Harringway.

558
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:12,220
-How much is a Harringway.

559
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:14,660
-Best you think true,
 the "Cosmostrator"

