595
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:17,330
-Now, we will leave the air.

596
00:19:17,330 --> 00:19:18,920
In the next two hours,
 the crew of eight

597
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,640
picked for the
 "Cosmostrator" will

