00:19:56,860 --> 00:19:59,510
-You'll be able to see
 and hear your heart.

614
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:00,010
-Psychedelic.

615
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:10,180
-I'm very glad you're
 coming with us, Sumiko.

616
00:20:10,180 --> 00:20:11,120
-What did you call me?

617
00:20:11,120 --> 00:20:12,610
-That way, I'll be near you.

618
00:20:15,460 --> 00:20:17,520
-Your heart beat is normal.

619
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:20,450
-Oh, tell her you love
