620
00:20:20,450 --> 00:20:21,630
-My heart isn't.

621
00:20:21,630 --> 00:20:22,390
-No, Brinkmann.

622
00:20:22,390 --> 00:20:22,890
No.

623
00:20:22,890 --> 00:20:23,560
No, please.

624
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:25,540
We mustn't speak of that ever.

625
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:27,150
-Let's talk about your pancreas.

626
00:20:27,150 --> 00:20:35,810
-OK. [SNORING]

