633
00:20:47,300 --> 00:20:49,220
Hiney, Homey.

634
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:49,720
Eeny.

635
00:20:52,670 --> 00:20:53,650
-Cupid again.

636
00:20:57,580 --> 00:20:59,610
