 Brinkmann again.

1671
00:54:04,040 --> 00:54:04,830
-Yeah.
 Yeah.

1672
00:54:04,830 --> 00:54:05,540
When I get to it.

1673
00:54:05,540 --> 00:54:08,400
When I get to it.

1674
00:54:08,400 --> 00:54:10,340
-Omega, back here.

1675
00:54:10,340 --> 00:54:14,210
Quickly

