00:55:24,180 --> 00:55:26,600
You will come to
 know that in time.

1717
00:55:26,600 --> 00:55:28,060
-I know how to cheer him up.

1718
00:55:28,060 --> 00:55:29,770
Tickle machine Tickle machine.

1719
00:55:29,770 --> 00:55:30,330
Whoa, ho, ho.

1720
00:55:30,330 --> 00:55:30,830
Whew, hoo.

