1778
00:57:09,860 --> 00:57:11,100
-All right, Tchen Yu.

1779
00:57:11,100 --> 00:57:11,990
-Why are you still here?
 Beat it.

1780
00:57:11,990 --> 00:57:13,570
-And while you're
 doing that, let's

1781
