-Omega, come on.

1787
00:57:29,760 --> 00:57:30,260
-Omega?

1788
00:57:30,260 --> 00:57:30,750
-Yeah.

1789
00:57:30,750 --> 00:57:31,620
Yeah.

1790
00:57:31,620 --> 00:57:32,600
