1791
00:57:32,600 --> 00:57:34,060
Beedy, beedy, beet-so.

1792
00:57:34,060 --> 00:57:36,120
That's the way these
 clowns order me around.

1793
00:57:36,120 --> 00:57:36,620
Huh.

1794
00:57:39,530 --> 00:57:40,930
-Crawler, please come in.

1795
00:57:40,930 --> 00:57:42,270
Crawler, please come in.

1796
00:57:42,270 --> 00:57:42,810
-Rib-it.

