1804
00:57:57,780 --> 00:57:59,900
What a hell of a line.

1805
00:57:59,900 --> 00:58:00,860
-It's incredible.

1806
00:58:00,860 --> 00:58:03,130
You think it's a
 machine, Orloff?

1807
00:58:03,130 --> 00:58:05,860
-Well, I can't say, yet.

1808
00:58:05,860 --> 00:58:06,830
