-Buggles.

1819
00:58:25,110 --> 00:58:25,610
Trombones.

1820
00:58:25,610 --> 00:58:26,390
-OK, Sikarna.

1821
00:58:26,390 --> 00:58:27,580
-Good.

1822
00:58:27,580 --> 00:58:28,600
