1823
00:58:28,600 --> 00:58:30,490
-Talua, stay in close
 contact with us.

1824
00:58:30,490 --> 00:58:31,700
-Very well, Professor.

1825
00:58:34,270 --> 00:58:36,010
-I am looking at Venus
 on the observation

1826
