1859
00:59:51,110 --> 00:59:53,000
Hm.

1860
00:59:53,000 --> 00:59:54,570
-Oh, that's sad.

1861
00:59:54,570 --> 00:59:56,930
-Yeah.

1862
00:59:56,930 --> 00:59:57,430
